# install.sh's backup convention, shared with the bazzite repo's
# `just link-dotfiles`. These land in $HOME rather than here, but the pattern is
# kept so a stray copy made inside the repo never gets committed.
*.bak-*

# Editor and OS droppings. .DS_Store earns its place here specifically because
# this repo is meant to be checked out on a Mac.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Karabiner-Elements churn. ~/.config/karabiner is a symlink to
# macos/config/karabiner (see install.sh's config_dir_links), so everything
# Karabiner writes lands in this working tree. karabiner.json and
# assets/complex_modifications/ are the point and are committed; these are
# rotated daily copies of the former and are not. Anchored to the one directory
# rather than a bare `automatic_backups/` so it cannot quietly swallow a
# same-named directory added later somewhere else.
macos/config/karabiner/automatic_backups/
